stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Pilot gate" as GateBox {
        [*] --> Withheld : plugged_at_startup false
        [*] --> Passed : plugged_at_startup true
        Withheld --> Passed : plug / A to car
        Passed --> Withheld : unplug / board CP A, Disconnected to car
    }

    note right of GateBox
        Withheld: board events, measurements and EV info
        are dropped; car CP commands do not reach the board.
        Passed: everything passes through.
    end note

    state "World fault" as FaultBox {
        [*] --> NoFault
        NoFault --> DiodeFail : inject_fault DiodeFail / board diode_fail(true)
        NoFault --> RcdError : inject_fault RcdError / board set_rcd_error(mA)
        NoFault --> CpErrorE : inject_fault CpErrorE (pilot passed) / board CP E
        DiodeFail --> NoFault : clear_fault / car's last diode_fail
        RcdError --> NoFault : clear_fault / car's last set_rcd_error
        CpErrorE --> NoFault : clear_fault / car's last CP
        CpErrorE --> NoFault : unplug
    }

    note right of FaultBox
        One fault at a time; a second injection is rejected.
        While a fault is active, the matching car command is
        remembered instead of reaching the board (CP E re-sends E).
    end note
